ess plan builds on Pro with advanced tools like AI-driven competition monitoring, benchmarking, gap-opportunity analysis, and more. It gives you the insights you need to scale and stay ahead of the competition. In contrast, the Base plan (our cheapest) is a set of essential PR tools. It’s ideal if you don’t need Media Monitoring but still want an easy, effective workflow for research and outreach.","Bs6jr9":"Generate content written in your own voice and style.","Btd8VZ":"Create email drafts with AI based on your key messages.","C8uHa+":"AI Agent automatically generates, schedules, and publishes posts.","CBSohX":"Branded and non-branded AI citations","CD83r1":"Position Changes","CDLJ0W":"Enterprise","CG2mSL":"Country-specific topic ideas","CIwI3e":"Competitive insights in email digests","COsMN6":"Marketing Optimization Analyst, Monash University","CY0FDf":"Up to {limit} profiles to track","CeFzoj":"{from} reports / up to {to} competitors","Cox7mC":"1 additional domain to authenticate","CtQvpm":"AI share of voice analysis","Cwubz/":"1,000 additional credits","CxD5t9":"For those making strategic data-driven decisions","CxfKLC":"Pages","CzYwFp":"J.P. Morgan","D/GfeO":"View your customer reviews on online directories (Yelp, TripAdvisor, Facebook, etc).","D2lgFC":"or <link>try custom plan</link>","D5guD1":"Base reports","D6UtAG":"Multi-million-page crawling","DAVzUp":"Semrush One","DAyHdD":"Monitor up to 15 domains at once — built for teams managing multiple client sites or brand properties.","DNeuzb":"Teams","DOFGXg":"Integrate Semrush traffic and market data into your own tools and workflows.","DQzcAT":"Prompt tracking","DWk6bL":"Know exactly what to write about—no deep keyword research needed.","DaYNXe":"AI search support","DlwPdA":"Semrush helps you build and measure brand visibility, everywhere search happens.","DvYNEK":"Ads History","Dzvlq2":"Backlinks","E/lxQg":"SEO share of voice","E38FiW":"Custom pricing available","EAiv4D":"custom","EQiwXc":"Pro+","ET7Wcj":"add