O plan will likely be the best option to start working with SEO only. If you're a professional SEO/GEO consultant or an agency with numerous clients, then you will be best suited to the Semrush Starter or Pro+ plan to cover visibility in both classic SEO and LLMs.","xlX+EF":"AI brand sentiment analysis","xo+fbK":"Plan your social media campaign in an interactive calendar to maintain an organized posting schedule.","xo6WJU":"Map Rank Tracker","xwEc8K":"API","xwWjNV":"Volkswagen Financial Services","y5EOAt":"save up to {discount}%","y9rstb":"Custom integrations & API","yC/F7l":"AI audience insights","yHGTK2":"Number of PDF reports you can generate and schedule for delivery to multiple email addresses. The number may vary depending on your subscription type.","yHKsB4":"Export your content to Google Docs.","yQu5ZZ":"Number of the most-visited pages for which you can get data.","yUoGlg":"Number of social media profiles for tracking.","yY3rFB":"Compare Semrush AI PR Toolkit plans to monitor brand reputation, discover media opportunities, analyze visibility, and support digital PR workflows.","ypMLYI":"AI Visibility Toolkit for additional users","yrxwXK":"Number of pages that you can crawl across all monitored websites.","z1Cc4s":"Seamlessly connect your Google Business Profile.","z4mQp7":"Track email reading time, view the top-performing emails, and see which of your pitches resulted in coverage.","z67c5K":"Advanced API data integration","zA0xu/":"Analyze how your competitors are performing and see if they are making any changes to their advertising strategy.","zDHyCs":"Subdomains","zG+hO0":"AI auto-replies to reviews per month","zP9K5f":"We’ll refund your money according to our <refundPolicyLink>official refund policy</refundPolicyLink>.","zS6mNL":"Group queries by brand to track both individual and combined brand data.","zlbbZv":"Number of contacts you can export from the media database each month.","zmWCLI":"AI Optimization","zn7x5B":"Snap Inc.","zoERbx":"+{price}/mo",